(4827419, 699635, 92309, '<td valign="top">I love the rich gold color!<br/> <br/>Evan</td>', 'I love the rich gold color! Evan', '2008-07-16 01:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827426, 699679, 92309, '<td valign="top">This is just my first look... but I think this is an awesome shot!!</td>', 'This is just my first look... but I think this is an awesome shot!!', '2008-07-16 01:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827429, 699439, 92309, '<td valign="top">Made me chuckle, extra point just for the good laugh! :)<br/> <br/>Evan</td>', 'Made me chuckle, extra point just for the good laugh! :) Evan', '2008-07-16 01:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827433, 699443, 86331, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shot. I think your composition is simple and to the point, but I think the shot in general is a bit too "dull". In my opinion, the lighting is too artificial and for a Martini glass and composure like this, I think it would''ve been a beautiful shot if your background was a bit more, ''tropical''. Or "up-beat". Hope I didn''t sound harsh.</td>', 'It''s a nice shot. I think your composition is simple and to the point, but I think the shot in general is a bit too "dull". In my opinion, the lighting is too artificial and for a Martini glass and composure like this, I think it would''ve been a beautiful shot if your background was a bit more, ''tropical''. Or "up-beat". Hope I didn''t sound harsh.', '2008-07-16 01:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827437, 698667, 92309, '<td valign="top">Ha, awesome photo! I love the creative nature of it! :)<br/> <br/>Evan</td>', 'Ha, awesome photo! I love the creative nature of it! :) Evan', '2008-07-16 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827444, 699565, 92309, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge?! Whoops!<br/> <br/>Evan</td>', 'Wrong challenge?! Whoops! Evan', '2008-07-16 01:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827449, 699598, 86331, '<td valign="top">Interesting composure and idea. I like the reflection, but I wish it was a bit more crisp and not as noisy. But in this shot, your idea and composure is nice. It''s a very up-beat composure, but there is something that is missing and/or a little off. I can''t put my finger on it, but It might be the angle and location of the glass. But anyway, good job and good luck.</td>', 'Interesting composure and idea. I like the reflection, but I wish it was a bit more crisp and not as noisy. But in this shot, your idea and composure is nice. It''s a very up-beat composure, but there is something that is missing and/or a little off. I can''t put my finger on it, but It might be the angle and location of the glass. But anyway, good job and good luck.', '2008-07-16 01:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4827455, 699355, 92309, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot, I''m giving you a 9! :)<br/> <br/>Evan</td>', 'This is a really cool shot, I''m giving you a 9! :) Evan', '2008-07-16 01:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
