(4831764, 698768, 89468, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. Nice atmosphere. It would have been nice to take adventage of the reflection in the bottom of the glass.</td>', 'Very interesting. Nice atmosphere. It would have been nice to take adventage of the reflection in the bottom of the glass.', '2008-07-17 23:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831833, 699582, 54645, '<td valign="top">One of the best. Go Jokers!</td>', 'One of the best. Go Jokers!', '2008-07-18 00:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831838, 699684, 54645, '<td valign="top">good choice.The composition is excellent particularly the relationship with the reflection.</td>', 'good choice.The composition is excellent particularly the relationship with the reflection.', '2008-07-18 00:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831841, 699625, 54645, '<td valign="top">Love green tea. The composition unfortunately is not appealing for me, I think it''s the tea bag. Not sure. Good color, and I like the green cast.</td>', 'Love green tea. The composition unfortunately is not appealing for me, I think it''s the tea bag. Not sure. Good color, and I like the green cast.', '2008-07-18 00:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831842, 699584, 54645, '<td valign="top">Good composition. Bird is blurry.</td>', 'Good composition. Bird is blurry.', '2008-07-18 00:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831848, 697667, 54645, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. Light is harsh yet still lacks contrast.</td>', 'Interesting idea. Light is harsh yet still lacks contrast.', '2008-07-18 00:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831864, 699620, 54645, '<td valign="top">Looks tasty, nice presentation and overall tone. Flash/light is too harsh and removed the depth of the bottle neck. I say give this another go with improved lighting and a little more space between the subject and background. Ahh, one last thing, your arrangement screams for a sharp flower, so more DOF would improve the subjects. Just an FYI, you may get called out for the border. I''m off to have a coffee! ;)</td>', 'Looks tasty, nice presentation and overall tone. Flash/light is too harsh and removed the depth of the bottle neck. I say give this another go with improved lighting and a little more space between the subject and background. Ahh, one last thing, your arrangement screams for a sharp flower, so more DOF would improve the subjects. Just an FYI, you may get called out for the border. I''m off to have a coffee! ;)', '2008-07-18 00:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831865, 698957, 86090, '<td valign="top">nicely done, good use of dof</td>', 'nicely done, good use of dof', '2008-07-18 00:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831866, 699677, 86090, '<td valign="top">nice colors and lighting</td>', 'nice colors and lighting', '2008-07-18 00:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831869, 698369, 86090, '<td valign="top">I like the tille, nice picture</td>', 'I like the tille, nice picture', '2008-07-18 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831870, 698122, 86090, '<td valign="top">the lighting seems a bit harsh, nice concept</td>', 'the lighting seems a bit harsh, nice concept', '2008-07-18 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831871, 698764, 54645, '<td valign="top">Finally, an intriguing composition. I like the light on the glass, the Patron bottle seems to be suffering with that reflection. The main subject could be sharper (by DPC standards), but still works. Good job.</td>', 'Finally, an intriguing composition. I like the light on the glass, the Patron bottle seems to be suffering with that reflection. The main subject could be sharper (by DPC standards), but still works. Good job.', '2008-07-18 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831872, 699647, 86090, '<td valign="top">nicely done</td>', 'nicely done', '2008-07-18 00:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831874, 699684, 86090, '<td valign="top">nice colors, good use of lighting</td>', 'nice colors, good use of lighting', '2008-07-18 00:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831875, 699654, 54645, '<td valign="top">You had me without the bordr;) I like the composition, and I''ll be interested to read the details of the subjection. The flash/light is too harsh, the reflections detract. I''m going to ignore the border.</td>', 'You had me without the bordr;) I like the composition, and I''ll be interested to read the details of the subjection. The flash/light is too harsh, the reflections detract. I''m going to ignore the border.', '2008-07-18 00:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831878, 699619, 86090, '<td valign="top">the lighting looks a bit harsh</td>', 'the lighting looks a bit harsh', '2008-07-18 00:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831880, 698753, 86090, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2008-07-18 00:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831882, 698571, 54645, '<td valign="top">No salt! Come on, much better with the salt!  Great composition and use of the shadow for negative space. Perspective is made more interesting by the top left corner.Good job. I''m not a fan of this type of border.</td>', 'No salt! Come on, much better with the salt!  Great composition and use of the shadow for negative space. Perspective is made more interesting by the top left corner.Good job. I''m not a fan of this type of border.', '2008-07-18 00:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831884, 698667, 86090, '<td valign="top">This is funny, I love the concept</td>', 'This is funny, I love the concept', '2008-07-18 00:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831886, 698320, 86090, '<td valign="top">cute dog, but... why is he in a beverage challenge?</td>', 'cute dog, but... why is he in a beverage challenge?', '2008-07-18 00:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831887, 699443, 86090, '<td valign="top">nice colors, good use of lighting</td>', 'nice colors, good use of lighting', '2008-07-18 00:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831890, 699439, 86090, '<td valign="top">this is cute</td>', 'this is cute', '2008-07-18 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831893, 699697, 54645, '<td valign="top">This image just does not work for me. I can''t make out the background or it''s relationship to the subject. Although I appreciate the effort with the side light, ultimately it seems to give the drink an odd perspective in relation to the white bottle, and it''s a bit harsh with the reflection. 5 for the effort :)</td>', 'This image just does not work for me. I can''t make out the background or it''s relationship to the subject. Although I appreciate the effort with the side light, ultimately it seems to give the drink an odd perspective in relation to the white bottle, and it''s a bit harsh with the reflection. 5 for the effort :)', '2008-07-18 00:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831895, 698957, 54645, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, pleasing composition. Love the light. Top right hurts a bit</td>', 'Nice, simple, pleasing composition. Love the light. Top right hurts a bit', '2008-07-18 00:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831900, 699355, 45475, '<td valign="top">Great idea to hit it with the coloured gels. Cool electric/neon look, would look fab in a nightclub.</td>', 'Great idea to hit it with the coloured gels. Cool electric/neon look, would look fab in a nightclub.', '2008-07-18 00:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831912, 699464, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wonderful graphic abstract, with an ever-so-slightly sexy curve. No vote but really wish I could. This is a great shot and one to be proud of (and printed!) no matter what the score outcome :)</td>', 'Wonderful graphic abstract, with an ever-so-slightly sexy curve. No vote but really wish I could. This is a great shot and one to be proud of (and printed!) no matter what the score outcome :)', '2008-07-18 00:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831919, 699583, 45475, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Few of things worth noting though: the backdrop creases are too visible, so maybe a shallower dof would have lessened that distraction; the pattern on the glass, although really cool, takes my attention away from the beer, maybe just a plain clear glass that''s been chilling in the freezer for a few minutes would have worked better, and lastly; a little more head on the beer! :)</td>', 'I like the idea. Few of things worth noting though: the backdrop creases are too visible, so maybe a shallower dof would have lessened that distraction; the pattern on the glass, although really cool, takes my attention away from the beer, maybe just a plain clear glass that''s been chilling in the freezer for a few minutes would have worked better, and lastly; a little more head on the beer! :)', '2008-07-18 00:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831922, 698738, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very nice light. The colours do indeed make me think "refreshing".</td>', 'Very nice light. The colours do indeed make me think "refreshing".', '2008-07-18 00:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831927, 699477, 45475, '<td valign="top">This looks to me like the white balance is a bit off, too much yellow. It''s just a tiny bit out of focus too. But that''s a fantastic drink, love the parasol :)</td>', 'This looks to me like the white balance is a bit off, too much yellow. It''s just a tiny bit out of focus too. But that''s a fantastic drink, love the parasol :)', '2008-07-18 01:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831929, 699679, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very VERY nice. Milk and cookies have never looked so appealing. Good light, nice symmetry and just an all round sweet shot. I''ll take the chocolate please :)</td>', 'Very VERY nice. Milk and cookies have never looked so appealing. Good light, nice symmetry and just an all round sweet shot. I''ll take the chocolate please :)', '2008-07-18 01:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831932, 699584, 45475, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light. Love that splash of blue from the bird. Nice.</td>', 'Beautiful light. Love that splash of blue from the bird. Nice.', '2008-07-18 01:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831942, 699501, 45475, '<td valign="top">Love the set up and light! Those drinks look so good, yum :)</td>', 'Love the set up and light! Those drinks look so good, yum :)', '2008-07-18 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831944, 698369, 45475, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Good colour and light.</td>', 'Very cool. Good colour and light.', '2008-07-18 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4831959, 699620, 45475, '<td valign="top">Oh yeah, I''ll have me one of those please :) The background''s not so appealing though. Maybe moving it a bit further away would have been better?</td>', 'Oh yeah, I''ll have me one of those please :) The background''s not so appealing though. Maybe moving it a bit further away would have been better?', '2008-07-18 01:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
