(4833820, 699650, 61818, '<td valign="top">Sometimes simple ideas like this work very well, especially on DPC.  Here are some things that need improving:<br/> <br/>- composition<br/>- fix the whitebalance<br/>- sharpen the image<br/>- make sure your focus is accurate</td>', 'Sometimes simple ideas like this work very well, especially on DPC.  Here are some things that need improving: - composition- fix the whitebalance- sharpen the image- make sure your focus is accurate', '2008-07-19 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833821, 697749, 76335, '<td valign="top">An origianl idea. The colors aren''t bad. This needs better lighting in the foreground or just recomposed if you wanted to use all natural light. Also, you should read a bit more about processing and also the challenge rules. For instance, your entry cannot be over 150K and you should use as much of it as possible. Your image is 38K which affects the quality of your image in a big way.</td>', 'An origianl idea. The colors aren''t bad. This needs better lighting in the foreground or just recomposed if you wanted to use all natural light. Also, you should read a bit more about processing and also the challenge rules. For instance, your entry cannot be over 150K and you should use as much of it as possible. Your image is 38K which affects the quality of your image in a big way.', '2008-07-19 12:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833823, 699283, 61818, '<td valign="top">Should have typed the title before downing half that glass!</td>', 'Should have typed the title before downing half that glass!', '2008-07-19 12:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833826, 699699, 61818, '<td valign="top">Poor composition, unflattering lighting, unappealing hairs and lint on the felt background.  The concept is novel, though unlikely to play well on DPC.  From a technical point of view, the shot doesn''t stand a chance.</td>', 'Poor composition, unflattering lighting, unappealing hairs and lint on the felt background.  The concept is novel, though unlikely to play well on DPC.  From a technical point of view, the shot doesn''t stand a chance.', '2008-07-19 12:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833835, 699679, 61818, '<td valign="top">Neat props, decent lighting.  The oddball crop really doesn''t work though.</td>', 'Neat props, decent lighting.  The oddball crop really doesn''t work though.', '2008-07-19 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833838, 698648, 61818, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you were trying a long exposure to get a dream effect with the flowing/spilling water.  Unfortunately it looks like that resulted in a little bit of shake showing up and the image losing sharpness.  The lighting is also very flat which make it difficult to distinguish between the water and the vase/glass.  Colors could use some saturating, certainly if entering this on DPC, and the composition itself is pretty unexciting.</td>', 'I''m assuming you were trying a long exposure to get a dream effect with the flowing/spilling water.  Unfortunately it looks like that resulted in a little bit of shake showing up and the image losing sharpness.  The lighting is also very flat which make it difficult to distinguish between the water and the vase/glass.  Colors could use some saturating, certainly if entering this on DPC, and the composition itself is pretty unexciting.', '2008-07-19 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4833840, 698320, 61818, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, winning recipe for the brown ribbon.  I applaud thinking outside of the box, especially so far outside the box that you''ve found yourself in a parallel universe.</td>', 'Hmmm, winning recipe for the brown ribbon.  I applaud thinking outside of the box, especially so far outside the box that you''ve found yourself in a parallel universe.', '2008-07-19 13:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
