(4834078, 699556, 90474, '<td valign="top">This could have been much better if the lighting had been arranged to show the splash and the strawberry.</td>', 'This could have been much better if the lighting had been arranged to show the splash and the strawberry.', '2008-07-19 16:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834084, 699023, 90474, '<td valign="top">A little bit of drool would have put this over the top.</td>', 'A little bit of drool would have put this over the top.', '2008-07-19 16:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834123, 698122, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good, but I''m not sure what the area on the left is, and the model''s eye makeup is distracting.</td>', 'This is good, but I''m not sure what the area on the left is, and the model''s eye makeup is distracting.', '2008-07-19 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834124, 699650, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good though the lighting is a little dull.</td>', 'Good though the lighting is a little dull.', '2008-07-19 18:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834125, 699439, 30982, '<td valign="top">By far my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'By far my favorite of the challenge.', '2008-07-19 18:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834126, 699627, 76335, '<td valign="top">"Doctor, can you tell me what to take? I said, doctor..." Looks tasty. Well done.</td>', '"Doctor, can you tell me what to take? I said, doctor..." Looks tasty. Well done.', '2008-07-19 18:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834130, 699592, 76335, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft and I think a lighter saucer (and contrast) is needed for the beans to show up. That, or different lighting.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft and I think a lighter saucer (and contrast) is needed for the beans to show up. That, or different lighting.', '2008-07-19 18:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834134, 699552, 76335, '<td valign="top">Bizarre title. The composition and processing is good (natural light?) but something more is needed to hold interest.</td>', 'Bizarre title. The composition and processing is good (natural light?) but something more is needed to hold interest.', '2008-07-19 18:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834137, 699052, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed and lit but nothing is really in focus (kind of like what would happen after finishing those off).</td>', 'Well composed and lit but nothing is really in focus (kind of like what would happen after finishing those off).', '2008-07-19 18:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834142, 699557, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get it, but I''m not trying real hard. The image could be bigger.</td>', 'Not sure I get it, but I''m not trying real hard. The image could be bigger.', '2008-07-19 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834144, 699655, 76335, '<td valign="top">The composition is a good idea, but the drink is somewhat distant. The chair and flowers take the lion''s share of the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'The composition is a good idea, but the drink is somewhat distant. The chair and flowers take the lion''s share of the viewer''s attention.', '2008-07-19 18:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834145, 699677, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good lighting. Looks very cool.</td>', 'Good lighting. Looks very cool.', '2008-07-19 18:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834177, 699587, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea and a fun shot. Wish the focus were a little crisper and the subject closer in the frame.</td>', 'Great idea and a fun shot. Wish the focus were a little crisper and the subject closer in the frame.', '2008-07-19 18:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834179, 699556, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur here.</td>', 'I like the motion blur here.', '2008-07-19 18:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834183, 699579, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like you didn''t put much time or thought into this. There are distractions in the background, the framing is haphazard, and the label isn''t even in view.</td>', 'Looks like you didn''t put much time or thought into this. There are distractions in the background, the framing is haphazard, and the label isn''t even in view.', '2008-07-19 18:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834187, 698667, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good idea -- maybe a tad silly, but you pulled it off well.</td>', 'Good idea -- maybe a tad silly, but you pulled it off well.', '2008-07-19 18:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834188, 699597, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good job with the lighting.</td>', 'Good job with the lighting.', '2008-07-19 18:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834191, 697758, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good, but maybe a tad oversharpened.</td>', 'Good, but maybe a tad oversharpened.', '2008-07-19 18:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834195, 699439, 76335, '<td valign="top">Certainly a different twist on the challenge, but I''m going with it. Great capture, and since you''re talking about milk, black and white was a good choice.</td>', 'Certainly a different twist on the challenge, but I''m going with it. Great capture, and since you''re talking about milk, black and white was a good choice.', '2008-07-19 18:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834199, 699506, 76335, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. Gotta love Nilsson.</td>', 'Fun shot. Gotta love Nilsson.', '2008-07-19 18:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834202, 698912, 76335, '<td valign="top">This is good. The selective desat more or less works, although the glass casts some distracting shadows on the subject''s face.</td>', 'This is good. The selective desat more or less works, although the glass casts some distracting shadows on the subject''s face.', '2008-07-19 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834204, 699464, 76335, '<td valign="top">A good abstract, but not enough here really to sustain interest.</td>', 'A good abstract, but not enough here really to sustain interest.', '2008-07-19 18:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834205, 699134, 76335, '<td valign="top">Original idea. Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Original idea. Focus is a bit soft.', '2008-07-19 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834206, 699023, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nothing profound here, but good for a chuckle. (I laughed at the tack.)</td>', 'Nothing profound here, but good for a chuckle. (I laughed at the tack.)', '2008-07-19 18:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834208, 699252, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lighting. I like the composition -- it has a certain rhythm to it.</td>', 'Great colors and lighting. I like the composition -- it has a certain rhythm to it.', '2008-07-19 18:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834214, 699703, 76335, '<td valign="top">More fruit than juice, but it looks like a nice treat anyway.</td>', 'More fruit than juice, but it looks like a nice treat anyway.', '2008-07-19 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834216, 698753, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed and beautifully abstract.</td>', 'Well composed and beautifully abstract.', '2008-07-19 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834219, 699584, 76335, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft, but I love the swizzlestick.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft, but I love the swizzlestick.', '2008-07-19 19:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834227, 699578, 76335, '<td valign="top">Good one, Jan. This one requires a bit of imagination -- more than I''m afraid most voters will want to strain their brain to give you, especially in the small amount of time they spend looking at images while voting. It is a little hard to tell what''s going on here. For me, that''s part of the intrigue, but for others, it might be part of the frustrtation.</td>', 'Good one, Jan. This one requires a bit of imagination -- more than I''m afraid most voters will want to strain their brain to give you, especially in the small amount of time they spend looking at images while voting. It is a little hard to tell what''s going on here. For me, that''s part of the intrigue, but for others, it might be part of the frustrtation.', '2008-07-19 19:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834239, 698738, 76335, '<td valign="top">The focus seems to be sharp on the tablecloth so that''s where the eyes are drawn.</td>', 'The focus seems to be sharp on the tablecloth so that''s where the eyes are drawn.', '2008-07-19 19:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834247, 699565, 76335, '<td valign="top">With wine perhaps?</td>', 'With wine perhaps?', '2008-07-19 19:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834249, 699477, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lighting is flat and the composition is not level.</td>', 'The lighting is flat and the composition is not level.', '2008-07-19 19:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834314, 698320, 8005, '<td valign="top">Am I missing something? How is this a beverage recipe? Good photo though.</td>', 'Am I missing something? How is this a beverage recipe? Good photo though.', '2008-07-19 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834315, 699134, 8005, '<td valign="top">The sky really compliments the beverage.</td>', 'The sky really compliments the beverage.', '2008-07-19 20:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834316, 698112, 8005, '<td valign="top">Ohh, I want one!</td>', 'Ohh, I want one!', '2008-07-19 20:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834317, 699643, 8005, '<td valign="top">Wow. Pretty.</td>', 'Wow. Pretty.', '2008-07-19 20:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834323, 698122, 78516, '<td valign="top">They eye makeup ruins an otherwise good shot. My eyes go straight to it and it distracts from the point of the photo.</td>', 'They eye makeup ruins an otherwise good shot. My eyes go straight to it and it distracts from the point of the photo.', '2008-07-19 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834333, 699271, 78516, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this photo, and the square ice cubes are cool, but I think the lemons and limes needed a big color pop to really make it stand out.</td>', 'I love the idea of this photo, and the square ice cubes are cool, but I think the lemons and limes needed a big color pop to really make it stand out.', '2008-07-19 20:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834335, 699506, 78516, '<td valign="top">This one totally made me smile and now I have the darn song in my head! :) 9</td>', 'This one totally made me smile and now I have the darn song in my head! :) 9', '2008-07-19 20:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834337, 699584, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to be short on detail and clarity a little. perhaps the lighting is a little too strong, but I''m not quite sure. A very good effort, however. I like the effect of the bubbles in the drink.</td>', 'Seems to be short on detail and clarity a little. perhaps the lighting is a little too strong, but I''m not quite sure. A very good effort, however. I like the effect of the bubbles in the drink.', '2008-07-19 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834339, 699682, 78516, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a Sonic ad and makes me thirsty! Good job!</td>', 'This reminds me of a Sonic ad and makes me thirsty! Good job!', '2008-07-19 20:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834342, 699684, 83313, '<td valign="top">Splash shots generally do pretty well. This ought to wind up placing fairly high. Nice work on the reflection.</td>', 'Splash shots generally do pretty well. This ought to wind up placing fairly high. Nice work on the reflection.', '2008-07-19 20:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834346, 699682, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a photo from a menu at Friday''s or someplace like that. Nice work.</td>', 'Looks like a photo from a menu at Friday''s or someplace like that. Nice work.', '2008-07-19 20:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834350, 699647, 78516, '<td valign="top">This is so cute and a refeshing change from all of the alcoholic or fizzy drink entries!</td>', 'This is so cute and a refeshing change from all of the alcoholic or fizzy drink entries!', '2008-07-19 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834351, 699686, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit, appealing colors. A seven for you.</td>', 'Beautifully lit, appealing colors. A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834354, 699635, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and photographed. Excellent, crisp focus. The text on the glass should either be more visible or not there at all. That aside, this is a standout. A seven for you.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and photographed. Excellent, crisp focus. The text on the glass should either be more visible or not there at all. That aside, this is a standout. A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834355, 699515, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors. This has warmth (maybe heat is a better word), motion and even rhythm. Nice job! A seven for you.</td>', 'Beautiful colors. This has warmth (maybe heat is a better word), motion and even rhythm. Nice job! A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834359, 699647, 76335, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed. Looks scrumptious. A seven for you.</td>', 'Nicely composed. Looks scrumptious. A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834360, 699355, 76335, '<td valign="top">Wow! This should do well. Great lighting and colors. Nice job! A seven for you.</td>', 'Wow! This should do well. Great lighting and colors. Nice job! A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834361, 699565, 83313, '<td valign="top">No doubt I you''ve already been told you put this in the wrong challenge. I won''t do a DNMC vote on it , as I''m sure it was accidental.</td>', 'No doubt I you''ve already been told you put this in the wrong challenge. I won''t do a DNMC vote on it , as I''m sure it was accidental.', '2008-07-19 20:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834364, 699456, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and lit. Intriguing colors. Almost abstract. Well done! A seven for you.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and lit. Intriguing colors. Almost abstract. Well done! A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834366, 699565, 78516, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I wish it wasn''t in the wrong catagory!</td>', 'Cool shot, I wish it wasn''t in the wrong catagory!', '2008-07-19 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834371, 699648, 76335, '<td valign="top">Not terribly original as there are a lot of these in this challenge, but it is well composed, lit and processed. I love the colors and the motion. A seven for you.</td>', 'Not terribly original as there are a lot of these in this challenge, but it is well composed, lit and processed. I love the colors and the motion. A seven for you.', '2008-07-19 20:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834372, 699679, 78516, '<td valign="top">Awww, this one made me smile!!</td>', 'Awww, this one made me smile!!', '2008-07-19 20:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834374, 699690, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The lighting is exquisite, and you''ve used the translucence of the drink and the lime to good effect. An eight for you.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The lighting is exquisite, and you''ve used the translucence of the drink and the lime to good effect. An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834375, 699406, 76335, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect. I would like to have seen the bottom of the pouring liquid not cropped off. An eight for you.</td>', 'Almost perfect. I would like to have seen the bottom of the pouring liquid not cropped off. An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834376, 699682, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well composed and exposed. The colors are terrific. An eight for you.</td>', 'Well composed and exposed. The colors are terrific. An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834378, 699643, 76335, '<td valign="top">The four pieces of chocolate on the saucer was more than just a nice touch -- I think it makes this image. Looks delicious! An eight for you.</td>', 'The four pieces of chocolate on the saucer was more than just a nice touch -- I think it makes this image. Looks delicious! An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834380, 699679, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well done. Love those glasses. Would like to have seen everything closer in the frame. An eight for you.</td>', 'Well done. Love those glasses. Would like to have seen everything closer in the frame. An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834381, 699147, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the warm glow that you''ve captured here -- same warmth you get with that first sip. I like the softness of this too. A nine for you.</td>', 'I love the lighting and the warm glow that you''ve captured here -- same warmth you get with that first sip. I like the softness of this too. A nine for you.', '2008-07-19 20:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834383, 699655, 78516, '<td valign="top">I''m crazy about the old chair and the daisies in this one! It''s so different from everything else I''ve seen in this challenge so far and I really like it! 9</td>', 'I''m crazy about the old chair and the daisies in this one! It''s so different from everything else I''ve seen in this challenge so far and I really like it! 9', '2008-07-19 20:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834384, 699582, 76335, '<td valign="top">This looks like a ribbon. Expert composition and processing. Good symmetry and balance and the colors are perfect. A nine for you.</td>', 'This looks like a ribbon. Expert composition and processing. Good symmetry and balance and the colors are perfect. A nine for you.', '2008-07-19 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834386, 698377, 76335, '<td valign="top">Absolutlely terrific. I believe there was an upside-down challenge a while back, and this would have been a shoo-in for that. It works here too, of course. Well composed and processed and fun for the eyes. An eight for you.</td>', 'Absolutlely terrific. I believe there was an upside-down challenge a while back, and this would have been a shoo-in for that. It works here too, of course. Well composed and processed and fun for the eyes. An eight for you.', '2008-07-19 20:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834388, 698764, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the tilt, but I like the colors and textures</td>', 'Not sure about the tilt, but I like the colors and textures', '2008-07-19 20:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834389, 699701, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautifully abstract. Congrats! This will score high. Can''t wait to read about the processing. A nine for you and my pick of the challenge.</td>', 'Beautifully abstract. Congrats! This will score high. Can''t wait to read about the processing. A nine for you and my pick of the challenge.', '2008-07-19 20:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834391, 699439, 83313, '<td valign="top">The natural choice! Creative thinking. Looking forward to seeing the recipe.</td>', 'The natural choice! Creative thinking. Looking forward to seeing the recipe.', '2008-07-19 20:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834396, 698480, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is really hard to make out.</td>', 'I''m afraid this is really hard to make out.', '2008-07-19 20:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834399, 698122, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice, but what is that to the left of the frame? Curtains? Plywood? Screen door?</td>', 'Nice, but what is that to the left of the frame? Curtains? Plywood? Screen door?', '2008-07-19 20:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834404, 698851, 83313, '<td valign="top">What''s the point in putting peanuts in a coke? I always wondered about that line from the Barbara Mandrell song. I guess I''ll find out when i read your recipe.</td>', 'What''s the point in putting peanuts in a coke? I always wondered about that line from the Barbara Mandrell song. I guess I''ll find out when i read your recipe.', '2008-07-19 20:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834407, 699274, 83313, '<td valign="top">All the details seem overwhelmed by the strong orange cast. Maybe some white balance changes could help?</td>', 'All the details seem overwhelmed by the strong orange cast. Maybe some white balance changes could help?', '2008-07-19 20:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834408, 699602, 83313, '<td valign="top">I just put on 5 pounds looking at this. Thanks! the fold of fabric in the corner distracts the eye a bit.</td>', 'I just put on 5 pounds looking at this. Thanks! the fold of fabric in the corner distracts the eye a bit.', '2008-07-19 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834410, 699030, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking semi-abstract. Love bubble macros.</td>', 'Cool looking semi-abstract. Love bubble macros.', '2008-07-19 20:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834411, 699271, 83313, '<td valign="top">I find this a bit on the bright side. I think a lot of the wonderful details in this image are washed out.</td>', 'I find this a bit on the bright side. I think a lot of the wonderful details in this image are washed out.', '2008-07-19 20:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834413, 698377, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Makes one take a second look.</td>', 'Nice idea. Makes one take a second look.', '2008-07-19 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834415, 699403, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit bright and washed out for my tastes. The DOF is a little shallow, the fruit on the plate seem to not quite be in sharp focus. Nice thing about still life is that you can use a narrow aperture to get a deep DOF and as long of an exposure as you need.</td>', 'A bit bright and washed out for my tastes. The DOF is a little shallow, the fruit on the plate seem to not quite be in sharp focus. Nice thing about still life is that you can use a narrow aperture to get a deep DOF and as long of an exposure as you need.', '2008-07-19 21:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834416, 699701, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great tones, colors nice and smooth. I predict at least a top 10 for this. I do see some visible JPEG compression artifacts, however. With a file size of 115k, you still had a little headroom for a lower compression factor.</td>', 'Great tones, colors nice and smooth. I predict at least a top 10 for this. I do see some visible JPEG compression artifacts, however. With a file size of 115k, you still had a little headroom for a lower compression factor.', '2008-07-19 21:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834417, 699655, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, though I am not sure the centered comp works best.</td>', 'Nice idea, though I am not sure the centered comp works best.', '2008-07-19 21:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834420, 699353, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like an advertisement for Krups. Nice and clear, strong but not overdone colors.</td>', 'Looks like an advertisement for Krups. Nice and clear, strong but not overdone colors.', '2008-07-19 21:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834421, 698647, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to be not quite as sharp as it could be. Nice comp and colors, however.</td>', 'Seems to be not quite as sharp as it could be. Nice comp and colors, however.', '2008-07-19 21:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834425, 699682, 56792, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot !!</td>', 'Nice Shot !!', '2008-07-19 21:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834446, 699677, 56792, '<td valign="top">Nice Shot !!</td>', 'Nice Shot !!', '2008-07-19 21:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4834543, 699565, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beverage?</td>', 'Beverage?', '2008-07-19 23:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
