(4835411, 699147, 96465, '<td valign="top">Although most of the entries employ solitary images as their concepts, this one works for me and garners extra points for boldness in entering a more complex theme. Contrasts is the main weakness of this image, viewers eyes are lured away from the main subject to the empty space on the left because of high contrast against the dark bottles on the right. <br/> <br/>Overall, I give this a 5/10 + 1 for concept 6/10</td>', 'Although most of the entries employ solitary images as their concepts, this one works for me and garners extra points for boldness in entering a more complex theme. Contrasts is the main weakness of this image, viewers eyes are lured away from the main subject to the empty space on the left because of high contrast against the dark bottles on the right.  Overall, I give this a 5/10 + 1 for concept 6/10', '2008-07-20 17:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
