(4835553, 698377, 96465, '<td valign="top">The shot could have worked if on the normal orientation, which exudes that refreshingly warm feeling especially on cold days where a hot cup of tee would be nice. <br/> <br/>Aside from the neck straining angle, over all concept and composition is OK, editing is good although the highlights could have been tweaked a little on the low side (its just me. I score this 6/10. Could have garnered an 7 or 8 if upside down :-)</td>', 'The shot could have worked if on the normal orientation, which exudes that refreshingly warm feeling especially on cold days where a hot cup of tee would be nice.  Aside from the neck straining angle, over all concept and composition is OK, editing is good although the highlights could have been tweaked a little on the low side (its just me. I score this 6/10. Could have garnered an 7 or 8 if upside down :-)', '2008-07-20 19:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
