(4835560, 699345, 96465, '<td valign="top">The overall concept of this photo does not coincide with the subject matter which is Recipe(Beverage). Although the shot of a wine glass or bottle gives a hint, the blue flame and the broken glass suggests this as more of a scientific experiment than a drink. Although i give credit to the preparation and execution of this shot as clearly much time and effort was devoted in creating it.<br/> <br/>As to editing, considering the limitations imposed on the entrants, i say its good. Overall I give the photo a 6/10.</td>', 'The overall concept of this photo does not coincide with the subject matter which is Recipe(Beverage). Although the shot of a wine glass or bottle gives a hint, the blue flame and the broken glass suggests this as more of a scientific experiment than a drink. Although i give credit to the preparation and execution of this shot as clearly much time and effort was devoted in creating it. As to editing, considering the limitations imposed on the entrants, i say its good. Overall I give the photo a 6/10.', '2008-07-20 19:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835565, 699579, 96465, '<td valign="top">Although the challenge is based on basic editing, the entry should have been given much thought and preparation. It would be very unfair if i judged this based solely on editing and not give points for other criteria such as concept, lighting, composition and the overall look to which the other entries excel.<br/> <br/>In spite of the limitations on the amount of editing work which could be performed on this photograph, much could have been done to improve this image through cropping, tone/color adjustments and the likes. Nevertheless  a point for being on topic :-)</td>', 'Although the challenge is based on basic editing, the entry should have been given much thought and preparation. It would be very unfair if i judged this based solely on editing and not give points for other criteria such as concept, lighting, composition and the overall look to which the other entries excel. In spite of the limitations on the amount of editing work which could be performed on this photograph, much could have been done to improve this image through cropping, tone/color adjustments and the likes. Nevertheless  a point for being on topic :-)', '2008-07-20 19:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835567, 699565, 96465, '<td valign="top">Off Topic</td>', 'Off Topic', '2008-07-20 19:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4835580, 699703, 96465, '<td valign="top">Commenting on the concept, the message of being cool &amp; refreshing, which should be evident on cold beverage photos has been lost and has been replaced by claustrophobia as the theme :-). More liquid, ice cubes, garnishing and less of the fruits could improve its concept. Composition put the subject at the center of the frame breaking the monotony of the rule of thirds look and works for this, however the subject is a little off center to the right.<br/> <br/>In spite of the limited editing one can do based on the rules, this went well for this photo. 5/10</td>', 'Commenting on the concept, the message of being cool & refreshing, which should be evident on cold beverage photos has been lost and has been replaced by claustrophobia as the theme :-). More liquid, ice cubes, garnishing and less of the fruits could improve its concept. Composition put the subject at the center of the frame breaking the monotony of the rule of thirds look and works for this, however the subject is a little off center to the right. In spite of the limited editing one can do based on the rules, this went well for this photo. 5/10', '2008-07-20 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
