(4836981, 698870, 85388, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and it''s a good shot. The drop on the lemon is a nice touch.<br/> <br/>I think it could use a litte more room on the left of the glass. <br/>Using a tripod would make this picture a bit less blurry. <br/>Also, the background draws some attention away from the picture.</td>', 'I like the composition, and it''s a good shot. The drop on the lemon is a nice touch. I think it could use a litte more room on the left of the glass. Using a tripod would make this picture a bit less blurry. Also, the background draws some attention away from the picture.', '2008-07-21 14:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
