(4838681, 699682, 76185, '<td valign="top">Nice bright and colourful. Well composed. Reflections perhaps a touch overwhelming but not too much of a distraction.</td>', 'Nice bright and colourful. Well composed. Reflections perhaps a touch overwhelming but not too much of a distraction.', '2008-07-22 15:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838683, 699584, 76185, '<td valign="top">Good bright high key shot.</td>', 'Good bright high key shot.', '2008-07-22 15:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838685, 699428, 76185, '<td valign="top">Good idea but the flat lighting and colours here let it down.</td>', 'Good idea but the flat lighting and colours here let it down.', '2008-07-22 15:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838686, 699688, 76185, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft droplet shot. Expected a lot of these here but this one works well with a nice minimalist feel.</td>', 'Lovely soft droplet shot. Expected a lot of these here but this one works well with a nice minimalist feel.', '2008-07-22 15:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838721, 699647, 94931, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but the one part that really bugs me is the right hand side where the white space below the saucer is. It really throws the balance off. I can also see your reflection in the saucer - when shooting reflective objects like this, you can cloak yourself in a white sheet so that just the lens is poking through, that way you don''t get in the reflection.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but the one part that really bugs me is the right hand side where the white space below the saucer is. It really throws the balance off. I can also see your reflection in the saucer - when shooting reflective objects like this, you can cloak yourself in a white sheet so that just the lens is poking through, that way you don''t get in the reflection.', '2008-07-22 16:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838736, 699592, 94931, '<td valign="top">I think if you had used a white cup and saucer, it would have made for a better photo by giving more contrast. As it is, the coffee beans are lost in the black plate.</td>', 'I think if you had used a white cup and saucer, it would have made for a better photo by giving more contrast. As it is, the coffee beans are lost in the black plate.', '2008-07-22 16:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838737, 699406, 94931, '<td valign="top">Is that your fingertip?</td>', 'Is that your fingertip?', '2008-07-22 16:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838738, 699464, 94931, '<td valign="top">Nice idea for an abstract/minimal composition. I think a little more light cast through the beer would help to boost the contrast.</td>', 'Nice idea for an abstract/minimal composition. I think a little more light cast through the beer would help to boost the contrast.', '2008-07-22 16:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4838740, 698122, 94931, '<td valign="top">It''s not bad, but I think her eyeliner detracts from the overall feeling of the image.</td>', 'It''s not bad, but I think her eyeliner detracts from the overall feeling of the image.', '2008-07-22 16:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
