(4839783, 699515, 48228, '<td valign="top"><b>Fantastic,</b> and again, so so you..... <br/> <br/>You always amaze me with your ability to come up with something new, with the wonderful <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=52549" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">IreneM</a> stamp of approval and excellence. I so admire what you do and how you do it..... <br/> <br/>You are one in a million, and I am proud to be one of your DPC friends.</td>', 'Fantastic, and again, so so you.....  You always amaze me with your ability to come up with something new, with the wonderful  IreneM stamp of approval and excellence. I so admire what you do and how you do it.....  You are one in a million, and I am proud to be one of your DPC friends.', '2008-07-23 01:06:47.000000', NULL, 0),
