(4839799, 698764, 50583, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the comments everyone!  I am pretty pleased with the results.  As always after I entered the photo I thought of different things I should have done or could have done.  This image was several firsts for me.  It was the first challenge in over a year that I''ve entered, the first challenge I''ve entered with my new Lumix camera, and the first time I had ever used Aperture instead of photoshop as I recently switched to a Mac.  I see lots of things I could have done differently with my setup and my editing techniques thanks to the comments as well as playing around with Aperture some more since the entry. <br/> <br/>Thanks again for all the comments!</td>', 'Thanks for all of the comments everyone!  I am pretty pleased with the results.  As always after I entered the photo I thought of different things I should have done or could have done.  This image was several firsts for me.  It was the first challenge in over a year that I''ve entered, the first challenge I''ve entered with my new Lumix camera, and the first time I had ever used Aperture instead of photoshop as I recently switched to a Mac.  I see lots of things I could have done differently with my setup and my editing techniques thanks to the comments as well as playing around with Aperture some more since the entry.  Thanks again for all the comments!', '2008-07-23 01:09:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4839800, 699647, 70369, '<td valign="top">WOW... This ended up being your 2nd highest scoring image.. And you didn''t want to enter it.. lol.. What the heck do you know.. Did this end up being the teams highest score.. I''m checking.. Congrats buddy !!!</td>', 'WOW... This ended up being your 2nd highest scoring image.. And you didn''t want to enter it.. lol.. What the heck do you know.. Did this end up being the teams highest score.. I''m checking.. Congrats buddy !!!', '2008-07-23 01:09:31.000000', NULL, 0),
