(4839959, 699308, 67237, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ddreamer:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice colors, but the face is a little bit to much to the left.<br/>The top of the noose may never pass the line of the cheak. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>He probably meant tip, not top. Never heard of that "rule" though. Besides, bearing in mind the title, her nose is not so important :-).<br/> <br/>Nice shot Ches!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-23 00:29:52.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by ddreamer: Nice colors, but the face is a little bit to much to the left.The top of the noose may never pass the line of the cheak.   He probably meant tip, not top. Never heard of that "rule" though. Besides, bearing in mind the title, her nose is not so important :-). Nice shot Ches!!', '2008-07-23 01:29:00.000000', '2008-07-23 01:29:52.000000', 0),
