(4840847, 699421, 63993, '<td valign="top">Thanks everybody for your kind comments. <br/>I wasn''t expecting anything from this photo as far as ratings, simply because there were much more flashier photos out there to vote on. <br/>The "value" of this photo lies in the idea, the planning, and the details behind what you see. In order to be able to take this shot 50 times until I got what I wanted, I had to use something instead of grape juice or any other liquid. I needed the scene to stay the same for hours, so I used lots of corn starch and food coloring. That''s where the "value" of this photo lies for me.<br/>Thanks again to all of you who voted.<br/>Titus<br/> <br/>The Obvious<br/>//photos.titusbartos.com</td>', 'Thanks everybody for your kind comments. I wasn''t expecting anything from this photo as far as ratings, simply because there were much more flashier photos out there to vote on. The "value" of this photo lies in the idea, the planning, and the details behind what you see. In order to be able to take this shot 50 times until I got what I wanted, I had to use something instead of grape juice or any other liquid. I needed the scene to stay the same for hours, so I used lots of corn starch and food coloring. That''s where the "value" of this photo lies for me.Thanks again to all of you who voted.Titus The Obvious//photos.titusbartos.com', '2008-07-23 11:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
