(4842495, 699701, 46314, '<td valign="top">You might not think this is a very creative photo, but I think it''s actually quite inspiring. I racked my brain trying to come up with an elaborate idea for this shoot, and in the end shot nothing, whereas you went with something and returned a beautiful photo. That takes a lot of creativity. Well done on the ribbon.</td>', 'You might not think this is a very creative photo, but I think it''s actually quite inspiring. I racked my brain trying to come up with an elaborate idea for this shoot, and in the end shot nothing, whereas you went with something and returned a beautiful photo. That takes a lot of creativity. Well done on the ribbon.', '2008-07-24 05:25:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4842668, 699439, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great b&amp;w, love the DOF choice, and absolutely met the challenge.  Take heart in how highly you were voted by your commenters.</td>', 'Great b&w, love the DOF choice, and absolutely met the challenge.  Take heart in how highly you were voted by your commenters.', '2008-07-24 10:20:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4842676, 698851, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think you made a good environmental portrait out of this - puts me right there on the scene.  There''s no harm in letting your viewer''s eye wander a bit.  Love the patient concentration of that doggie. :)</td>', 'I think you made a good environmental portrait out of this - puts me right there on the scene.  There''s no harm in letting your viewer''s eye wander a bit.  Love the patient concentration of that doggie. :)', '2008-07-24 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
