(4842982, 699308, 56243, '<td valign="top">I gave you a six becuase I loved the clarity and the colors.  The reason for me it didn''t score higher was really by no fault of yours.  To me the model looked bored and not arroused.  Since the title is Oral sex on the beach, because that''s the name of the drink she should be slightly arroused or have a mysterious smile to make the viewer wonder what she''s been up to.</td>', 'I gave you a six becuase I loved the clarity and the colors.  The reason for me it didn''t score higher was really by no fault of yours.  To me the model looked bored and not arroused.  Since the title is Oral sex on the beach, because that''s the name of the drink she should be slightly arroused or have a mysterious smile to make the viewer wonder what she''s been up to.', '2008-07-24 13:58:01.000000', NULL, 0),
