(4844642, 699620, 90495, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Hatchet:</b></div><hr/><i> NOTE TO SELF.....<br/> <br/>NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL.. <br/> <br/>NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL.. <br/> <br/>NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL.. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you use Lightroom, you can make it save two different copies of your images when uploading them to your computer. <br/> <br/>What was it scoring? And why was this being asked to be validated? <br/> <br/>Wait, I see it now, the border that looks like a vignette most probably. Tough luck. It was a nice shot except for that highlight on the bg.</td>', 'Originally posted by Hatchet: NOTE TO SELF..... NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL..  NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL..  NEVER EDIT YOUR ORIGINAL..   If you use Lightroom, you can make it save two different copies of your images when uploading them to your computer.  What was it scoring? And why was this being asked to be validated?  Wait, I see it now, the border that looks like a vignette most probably. Tough luck. It was a nice shot except for that highlight on the bg.', '2008-07-25 14:35:51.000000', NULL, 0),
