(4845500, 698912, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great image. How did you desat the colours in Basic Editing? Please tell.<br/> <br/>The lower scores thought maybe this was illegal in BE.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-26 08:26:31.</i></td>', 'Great image. How did you desat the colours in Basic Editing? Please tell. The lower scores thought maybe this was illegal in BE.', '2008-07-26 09:25:11.000000', '2008-07-26 09:26:31.000000', 0),
