(4877716, 698912, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve sometimes done a black border like that which blended into the image area and then realized it was not "obviously a border". A nitpicky DQ for sure, but rules is rules, I suppose.<br/> <br/>An excellent example of PP improving a so-so original image. Your adjustments really brought out some detail that was not obvious in the original.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-09 22:37:20.</i></td>', 'I''ve sometimes done a black border like that which blended into the image area and then realized it was not "obviously a border". A nitpicky DQ for sure, but rules is rules, I suppose. An excellent example of PP improving a so-so original image. Your adjustments really brought out some detail that was not obvious in the original.', '2008-08-09 23:34:58.000000', '2008-08-09 23:37:20.000000', 0),
